<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40678" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί-πτωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>onslaught</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰφνίδιον
				ποιεῖσθαι τὴν ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				18.9.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>falling
				</i><i>upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωνῆς ἐπὶ μίαν τάσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nicom.
					<u>Harm.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>. <i>falling
				over</i> the forehead, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριχῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antyll.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.8.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. <i>falling
				to</i> one, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλήρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.74o
				</span></i>
			d (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>.
				<i>chance</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τυχική</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.211S.
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theag.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				3.1.117
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				2.3.7
			</span></i>.</div>
